              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Kandi ucure intebe y'ihongerero mu izahabu nziza, uburebure bwayo bw'umurambararo bube mikono ibiri n'igice, ubugari bwayo bube mukono umwe n'igice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ureme abakerubi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "abakerubi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "umutwe umwe w'abamarayika witwa abakerubi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " babiri mu izahabu, ubareme mu izahabu icuzwe, ubareme mu mitwe yombi y'iyo ntebe y'ihongerero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ureme umukerubi umwe mu mutwe umwe, n'undi mu wundi, bacuranwe n'intebe y'ihongerero mu mitwe yayo yombi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bakerubi batande amababa yabo hejuru ngo bayakingiririshe iyo ntebe y'ihongerero, berekerane, barebe iyo ntebe y'ihongerero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ushyire iyo ntebe y'ihongerero kuri ya sanduku, uyishyiremo Ibihamya nzaguha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ni ho nzajya mbonanira nawe hejuru y'intebe y'ihongerero, hagati y'abo bakerubi bari ku isanduku y'Ibihamya, ni ho nzajya nkubwirira amategeko yanjye yose ntegeka Abisirayeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
